{"resourceIdentifier":"3666","resourceName":"Xingu-Araguaia Grouped REDD+ Project","description":"The primary objective of the Xingu-Araguaia Grouped REDD+ Project is to avoid the unplanned deforestation (AUD) in a 10,004.42-ha project area, consisting of 100% Amazon rainforest. The project area is in São José do Xingu and São Félix do Araguaia, in the State of Mato Grosso, Southern Amazon.\r\n\r\nBeyond the project’s ecological and carbon benefits, a proportion of the carbon credits generated will be dedicated to improving the social and environmental conditions in the project region, specifically contributing to improving deforestation control, and developing environmental education and other social activities. The contribution to sustainability is being monitored through the application of the SOCIALCARBON® Standard.\r\n\r\nThe present REDD project is expected to avoid a predicted 4,312 ha of deforestation, equating to 1,421,408 tCO2e in emissions reductions over the 30-year project lifetime (15-October-2020 to 14-October-2050), with an annual average of 47,380 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":-11.110699,"longitude":-52.486232},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-17","endExclusive":"2023-02-17","endInclusive":"2023-02-16"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3666"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mato Grosso"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Future Carbon International LLC"},{"type":"string","value":"Florida, United States"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"38389"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"9008 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"EcoLance Private Limited"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 15/10/2020 - 14/10/2050"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82301&IDKEY=siofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3d113493079","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD_Xingu-Araguaia REDD+ Project v01.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-09T18:09:27.19Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=81620&IDKEY=4kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909l112553980","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"2022 08 19 - Listing - Xingu-Araguaia.signed.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-12-26T20:07:24.653Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_OTHER_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Other Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=72716&IDKEY=fiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf100275364","documentType":"KML File","documentName":"PA_Xingu-Araguaia.kml","uploadDate":"2022-08-19T21:28:57.93Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=108173&IDKEY=nlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098f149170567","documentType":"Other","documentName":"XINGU-ARAGUAIA GROUPED REDD+ PROJECT - DEED OF ACCESSION.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-02-24T17:27:39.133Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=111375&IDKEY=898klasmf